  "described": {
    "alt_text": "A Stable Diffusion landscape of a dense village of red and orange roofs on a river delta with many channels and islands, framed by gnarled trees and boulders.",
    "description": "A square generated image in a painterly style. A broad river delta spreads across the middle with many channels, ponds and grassy islands, under grey blue mountains and soft clouds. In its centre a dense cluster of small houses with red and orange roofs fills a peninsula. Gnarled trees with flat canopies frame the left and right edges, with a large grey boulder at right, and the foreground is a slope of brown earth, rocks and green tufts.",
    "impression": "This variation keeps the commission's central town and turns the lake into a maze of water. The crowded village is the closest the machine came to the density of the original drawing, but its crowd is roofs rather than creatures.",
